# Enables automatic sending for the Contact page form (app/api/contact).
# Without this set, the form still works — it just falls back to opening
# the visitor's own email client, pre-addressed to novamarko72@gmail.com.
#
# How to get one:
#   1. Turn on 2-Step Verification on the novamarko72@gmail.com Google account:
#      https://myaccount.google.com/security
#   2. Generate an App Password: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
#      (choose "Mail" as the app — Google gives you a 16-character code)
#   3. Paste it below (no spaces), then also add it in Vercel under
#      Project Settings -> Environment Variables for production.
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=
